# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the Mac leg's HostRing step
# (.github/workflows/_build.yml), and for a local ThreadSanitizer build.
#
# Lock-order reports ("deadlock") only, and only inside the Vulkan layer and
# driver, whose own locks ThreadSanitizer sees through the interposed pthread
# calls in code this repository does not build: the Khronos validation layer
# takes two of its rwlocks in both orders as a kernel's set layout is made and
# destroyed, on one thread. Each entry names a library, never a first-party
# frame, and no data race is suppressed: those are what the step checks.
deadlock:libVkLayer_khronos_validation
# MoltenVK, the Mac's driver, for the same kind of report from its own locks.
deadlock:libMoltenVK
